### Daftar produk ACTIVE di satu kategori daun
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products?categoryId=200&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=5

### Detail produk
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/5

### Produk yang tidak ada (404, ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/999999

### Ubah produk
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/5
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rok Polos Katun 5", "price": 125000, "status": "ACTIVE" }

### Pencarian
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/search?q=kaos&size=5

### Pencarian, potongan berikutnya (isi after dengan nextAfter)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/search?q=kaos&after=1050&size=5

### Pohon kategori
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories/tree

### Tambah kategori
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kategori Coba", "parentId": 11 }

### Impor produk
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "sku": "HTTP-0001", "name": "Kaos Coba", "description": "Contoh",
      "price": 50000, "status": "DRAFT", "categoryId": 111 }
  ]
}
